Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Eigenvector Continuation Demo", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"d28080b1-7820-4df6-93d7-56d552c7c865"],

Cell["\<\
This notebook shows how eigenvector continuation works using simple real \
symmetric (Hermitian) matrices. We build a family of matrices H(c) = H0 + c \
H1, find the exact ground state at many values of c, then show how just three \
sampled eigenvectors can reproduce the whole curve.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"32150909-e7b8-4b31-999b-a19277c51224"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1. Setup", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"8157c9fb-a4e0-4a00-afcf-3be6de874856"],

Cell["\<\
We build two random symmetric 4 by 4 matrices, H0 and H1. H(c) is their \
combination for any coupling c.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"12e1faf6-5450-4fd9-9b4c-79c7d0f8533a"],

Cell["\<\
n = 40;
SeedRandom[1];
H0 = Table[RandomReal[{-1, 1}], {n}, {n}];
H0 = (H0 + Transpose[H0])/2;
H1 = Table[RandomReal[{-1, 1}], {n}, {n}];
H1 = (H1 + Transpose[H1])/2;
H[c_] := H0 + c*H1;\
\>", "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9938968348369293`*^9, 3.993896835343362*^9}, 
   3.993897547413927*^9},
 CellLabel->"In[9]:=",ExpressionUUID->"c88aa18b-7b9c-492e-bb2e-d940e0f7a782"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["2. Exact diagonalization", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"15162d8a-af23-4ce7-a55f-6f2218fc7982"],

Cell["\<\
This function returns the lowest eigenvalue and its eigenvector for H(c), \
found by direct exact diagonalization.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"cd65bf9d-292a-46f2-8941-e518665dd175"],

Cell["\<\
ExactGround[c_] := Module[{vals, vecs, pos},
  {vals, vecs} = Eigensystem[H[c]];
  pos = Ordering[vals, 1][[1]];
  {vals[[pos]], vecs[[pos]]}
];\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[16]:=",ExpressionUUID->"dbf56f46-a85c-498f-bc93-85ac5731b7c5"],

Cell["\<\
We scan c from minus 3 to 3 and record the exact ground state energy at each \
point.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b7234741-2967-40db-b4c6-f9ce3c6b34ee"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
cRange = Table[c, {c, -3, 3, 0.2}];
exactEnergies = Table[First[ExactGround[c]], {c, cRange}];
ListLinePlot[Transpose[{cRange, exactEnergies}],
  PlotLabel -> \"Exact ground state energy\",
  AxesLabel -> {\"c\", \"E0\"}]\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[17]:=",ExpressionUUID->"7f3f418f-9653-4771-9388-58c656596bb2"],

