Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["3. Eigenvector continuation", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"da496737-df65-4ccc-9e2a-a7476f87dcf0"],

Cell["\<\
We pick just three sampling points and compute the exact ground state \
eigenvector at each one. These three vectors are our small basis.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4a6baf2f-1e7e-461f-a87d-ffda79243e26"],

Cell["\<\
cSample = {-2, -1, -0.5, 0, 0.5, 1, 2};
vectorsSample = Table[Last[ExactGround[c]], {c, cSample}];
basis = Transpose[vectorsSample];\
\>", "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.99389763280171*^9, 3.993897666757175*^9}, 
   3.993958091028981*^9},
 CellLabel->"In[20]:=",ExpressionUUID->"ad36127a-a117-40a8-b465-b16fced625ed"],

Cell["\<\
We build the overlap matrix of the basis vectors. Then for any target c we \
project H(c) onto this small basis and solve the resulting small eigenvalue \
problem.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e3277da9-8cf0-4db8-9e5d-ed5acd2728f6"],

Cell["\<\
NMatrix = Transpose[basis].basis;

ECGround[c_] := Module[{HSmall, vals, vecs, pos},
  HSmall = Transpose[basis].H[c].basis;
  {vals, vecs} = Eigensystem[{HSmall, NMatrix}];
  pos = Ordering[vals, 1][[1]];
  vals[[pos]]
];\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[23]:=",ExpressionUUID->"010ca7b7-51ea-4bb5-bd5e-f90f11aeba6b"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["4. Compare EC vs exact", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"f2a19a14-4b75-4d2e-ae99-9a683c586651"],

Cell["\<\
We compute the eigenvector continuation estimate at the same c values as \
before, using only three sampling points, and plot both curves together.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7776da32-a133-4dce-8527-2767f5fc6b48"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
ecEnergies = Table[ECGround[c], {c, cRange}];

ListLinePlot[
  {Transpose[{cRange, exactEnergies}], Transpose[{cRange, ecEnergies}]},
  PlotLegends -> {\"Exact\", \"Eigenvector continuation\"},
  PlotLabel -> \"Exact vs Eigenvector continuation\",
  AxesLabel -> {\"c\", \"E0\"}]\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[29]:=",ExpressionUUID->"b7faa314-02ec-4636-96ff-f3a5fcc30bbc"],

